nd.  Each hit has a 20% chance of granting you $16361s2 extra $lattack:attacks; with $16361s1 extra melee attack power. When applied to main hand, disables any benefit you personally receive from Windfury Totem. Lasts for 60 minutes.","","Rango 4","Imbuye de viento el arma del chamán. Cada golpe tiene un 20% de probabilidad de otorgarte $16361s2 $lataque extra:ataques extras; con $16361s1 p. de poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo adicional. Dura 60 minutos.",""],[17330,17330,"","Web yourself to the ground, preventing jumping and negating the next Knockback effect taken within $d.","Negating the next Knockback effect taken. Unable to jump.","","Anula el siguiente efecto de repulsión recibido en un plazo de $d, pero impide saltar mientras está activa.","Anula el siguiente efecto de repulsión recibido. Incapaz de saltar."],[23684,23684,"","2% chance on successful spellcast to increase your Spirit by $s1 for $d.","Spirit increased by $s1.","","$h% de probabilidad de que un hechizo que alcance al objetivo aumente $s1 p. tu espíritu durante $d.","Espíritu aumentado $s1 p."],[23686,23686,"","Chance to strike your melee target with lightning for $23687s1 Nature damage.","","","Probabilidad de golpear a tu objetivo cuerpo a cuerpo con relámpagos, lo que inflige $23687s1 p. de daño de Naturaleza. El daño a los enemigos acuáticos es $s2 veces mayor.",""],[23688,23688,"","2% chance on successful spellcast to increase your Spirit by $23684s1 for $23684d.","","","$h% de probabilidad de que un hechizo que alcance al objetivo aumente $23684s1 p. tu espíritu durante $23684d.",""],[23689,23689,"","Sometimes heals bearer of $23682s1 damage when damaging an enemy in melee.","","","A veces sana al portador $23682s1 p. de daño al dañar al enemigo cuerpo a cuerpo. Este efecto se produce el doble de veces en bastiones y ciudades.",""],[23863,23863,"","4% chance on melee attack of restoring $23864s energy.","","","4% de probabilidad durante un ataque cuerpo a cuerpo de recuperar $23864s p. de e